ition-of-lateral-hypothalamus-inputs-to-the-paraventricular-thalamus-reduces-goal-tracking-in-a-behaviorally-flexible-subgroup-of-male-rats.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 01:36:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/chemogenetic-inhibition-of-lateral-hypothalamus-inputs-to-the-paraventricular-thalamus-reduces-goal-tracking-in-a-behaviorally-flexible-subgroup-of-male-rats</guid></item><item><title>人类的眼细胞可能首次恢复活力</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/eye-cells-may-have-been-rejuvenated-for-the-first-time-in-people</link><description>一种实验疗法可以解决可能导致视力丧失的眼部老化细胞的问题。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/eye-cells-may-have-been-rejuvenated-for-the-first-time-in-people2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 01:21:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/eye-cells-may-have-been-rejuvenated-for-the-first-time-in-people</guid></item><item><title>科学家改造微生物来帮助人类定居火星</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/scientists-engineer-microbe-to-help-humanity-settle-mars</link><description>现在，加利福尼亚州埃默里维尔先锋实验室的研究人员已经开发出一种微生物，他们认为这可能是火星改造的有用、安全的第一步。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-engineer-microbe-to-help-humanity-settle-mars2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 01:06:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/scientists-engineer-microbe-to-help-humanity-settle-mars</guid></item><item><title>3：我们最强大的基础世界模型</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/3-our-most-powerful-foundation-world-model</link><description>Odyssey-3：迈向物理人工智能世界模型的新一步&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/3-our-most-powerful-foundation-world-model.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:51:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/3-our-most-powerful-foundation-world-model</guid></item></channel></rss>